\description{
The value of a convertible bond on a binomial lattice with the Tsiveriotis-Fernandes treatment of credit risk,
as QuantLib's \code{ConvertibleFixedCouponBond} with \code{BinomialCRRConvertibleEngine}, under Black-Scholes-Merton with a
flat continuous rate, dividend yield and volatility. The lattice carries the value of the bond and the probability that
it ends in conversion at each node; a node discounts at \code{rate} where the bond is converted and at \code{rate + credit_spread}
where it is not, blended by that probability. The lattice runs from \code{settlement_date} to the last exercise date in
\code{steps} steps; dates are placed on the nearest step, the earlier one on a tie.
}
\details{
